%SIXMD 1
# @?MEMSTAT - PRINT MEMORY DETAILS

## DESCRIPTION

MEMSTAT PRINTS THE DETAILED MEMORY AND TABLE COUNTERS EXPOSED BY THE CURRENT
SYSTEM INTERFACE, INCLUDING CORE, PROCESS, MEMFS, PROCESS-SLOT, AND FILE-SLOT
USAGE.
USAGE IS 'MEMSTAT'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
